      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "TahmKenchW",
        "name": "Abyssal Dive",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Dive down and then re-appear at target location, damaging and knocking up all enemies in an area.",
        "bodyHtml": "Dive down and then re-appear at target location, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/135/170/205/240 + (150% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Up</span> all enemies in an area for 1 second. Hitting at least one enemy champion refunds 40/42.5/45/47.5/50% of the Cooldown and <span>Mana</span> cost. <br /><br /><span style=\"color: #0bf7de\">Devoured</span> allies can be taken along for the ride (but can always hop out early).<br /><br />Enemies cannot see where you are headed to until 0.75 seconds into the channel.<br /><br /><span style=\"color: #cccccc\"><span>'Boy, the world's one river, and I'm its king. Ain't no place I ain't been; ain't no place I can't go again.'</span></span>",
