      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "TahmKenchRWrapper",
        "name": "Devour",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Tahm Kench devours a champion for a few seconds, dealing magic damage if they are an enemy, or shielding them if they are an ally.",
        "bodyHtml": "Tahm Kench devours a champion for a few seconds. He can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to spit them out.<br /><br /><span>Enemy Champions:</span> Require 3 stacks of <span>An Acquired Taste</span>. Are devoured for up to 3 seconds and take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">100/250/400 ( + (15% + (7% per 100 Ability Power)) of their Max Health) magic damage</span>. Tahm Kench is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 40% and <span>Grounded</span> during this effect.<br /><br /><span>Ally Champions:</span> Are devoured for up to 3 seconds and are granted <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(650/800/950 + (100% Ability Power)) Shield</span> which decays gradually after being spit out. Allies can also choose to exit early. Tahm Kench is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Grounded</span> during this effect, but can cast <span>Abyssal Dive</span> and gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">60% Move Speed</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Allies can see when this spell is available next to your health bar (enemies cannot).<br />Shield decays by 200 per second.</span>",
